OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies and woman is injured in
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died in a crash involving two
OL,7,Fcars in Pontefract.
OL,9,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,10,FA628 Hemsworth Bypass at about 06:00
OL,11,FBST on Saturday following a collision
OL,12,Finvolving a blue Volkswagen Polo and a
OL,13,Fwhite Ford EcoSport.
OL,15,FA 57-year-old man died at the scene. A
OL,16,F60-year-old woman was taken to hospital
OL,17,Fwith injuries which are not thought to
OL,18,Fbe life-threatening, police said.
OL,20,FA 20-year-old man has been arrested on
OL,21,Fsuspicion of causing death by dangerous
OL,22,Fdriving.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
